PATH     PATH0 PATH1 PATH2 PATH3
ROCK     ROCK0 ROCK1 ROCK2 ROCK3   SOLID
WALL     WALL0 WALL1 WALL2 WALL3   SOLID
SAND     SAND0 SAND1 SAND2 SAND3
